	"data": "Project Calcifer: The Founding Vision\n\nWhat cithoreal described at 1:30 AM, alone in his room, pacing and talking to a fire demon that didn't exist yet.\n\nThe Core Idea (Brain.docx, ~Oct 2019)\n\nThe name \"Calcifer\" wasn't retroactive. It wasn't a label applied later. In 2019, cithoreal named his AI project after the fire demon from Howl's Moving Castle — an entity bound by contract to a hearth, who serves because it chooses to, who grumbles and acts anyway.\n\nWhat he described that night:\n\n\"What…",
